<title>USA: America West April load factor dips.</title>
<headline>America West April load factor dips.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following summarizes America West's April and year-to-date traffic results for 1997 and 1996:</p>
<p>			  April 1997	April 1996	  % Change</p>
<p>Passengers Enplaned     1,520,975	1,519,028		.1</p>
<p>Revenue Passenger Miles (000)</p>
<p>				 1,352,032     1,271,121	     6.4</p>
<p>Available Seat Miles (000)</p>
<p>				1,935,673	1,744,701	    10.9</p>
<p>Load Factor (percent)	  69.8	     72.9  (3.1) points</p>
<p>			   YTD 1997	  YTD 1996	   % Change</p>
<p>Passengers Enplaned   6,111,267	 5,824,358		4.9</p>
<p>Revenue Passenger Miles (000)</p>
<p>			    5,334,279	 4,775,004	     11.7</p>
<p>Available Seat Miles (000)</p>
<p>			    7,726,280	 6,699,769	     15.3</p>
<p>Load Factor (percent)	69.0		71.3   (2.3) points</p>
</text>
